:: 诺斯塔启程
<<set $tower to setup.newTower()>>
<<goto "诺斯塔之塔">>

:: 诺斯塔之塔
<<nobr>>
<<set _room to setup.towerRooms[$tower.floor]>>
<div class="tower-shell">
<header class="tower-heading">
<p class="tower-kicker">NOUSTA’S TOWER · 双时之塔</p>
<h1><<print _room.name>></h1>
<p class="tower-era"><<print $tower.era === 'past' ? '◈ 过去 · 哥布林占领时期' : '◇ 现在 · 荒塔遗迹'>> · <<print $tower.floor + 1>> / 11 层</p>
</header>
<<if $tower.ending>>
<section class="ending-card">
<h2><<print ({free:'结局 · 梁外的天空',treasure:'结局 · 满袋金币',leave:'结局 · 带回见闻'})[$tower.ending]>></h2>
<p><<print $tower.message>></p>
<p>探索了 <<print $tower.visited.length>> / 22 处过去与现在的场景，留下 <<print $tower.notes.length>> 条手记。</p>
</section>
<<else>>
<p class="tower-goal">塔顶有什么，让诺斯塔迟迟不肯离开？沿着楼梯上去，看看它的过去与现在。</p>
<<if $tower.message>><p class="tower-feedback" role="status"><<print $tower.message>></p><</if>>
<div class="tower-prose"><p><<print _room[$tower.era]>></p></div>
<<if $tower.floor is 0 and $tower.era is 'present'>><p class="tower-warning">断口上方够不到落脚处。转动时光杖，回到石阶还完整的过去，就能上楼。</p><</if>>
<<if $tower.floor is 5 and $tower.era is 'past' and not $tower.guards>><p class="tower-warning">守卫不让陌生人上楼。送上热饭、用浮空符文绕行，或切到现在，都能通过。</p><</if>>
<<if $tower.floor is 9 and $tower.era is 'past'>><p class="tower-warning">驯龙者挡着梯子。你握紧仍在发光的杖：切到现在，就能绕开他们。</p><</if>>
<<if $tower.floor is 10 and $tower.era is 'present'>><p class="tower-warning">想带它离开，需要先读养龙书，在过去赢得幼龙的信任，再用浮空符文或尚有次数的护符展示出口。若要冒着龙火取宝，需要防火盾或卷轴。两种选择都会结束这次冒险；准备不足时，可以下楼寻找，或转动杖头回到过去。</p><</if>>
<nav class="tower-actions" aria-label="场景行动">
<<for _action range setup.towerActions($tower)>>
<<capture _action>>
<<link _action.label>><<set $tower to setup.towerAct($tower, _action.id)>><<goto "诺斯塔之塔">><</link>>
<</capture>>
<</for>>
</nav>
<details class="tower-panel"><summary>需要一点提示？</summary><p><<print _room.hint>></p></details>
<</if>>
<details class="tower-panel"><summary>探险手记 · <<print $tower.notes.length>> 条线索</summary>
<<if $tower.notes.length>><ul><<for _note range $tower.notes>><li><<print _note>></li><</for>></ul><<else>><p>手记还是空白。读书或调查时，你会把找到的线索记在这里。</p><</if>>
<p>随身物品：森图里亚之杖<<if $tower.book>>、养龙书笔记<</if>><<if $tower.rune>>、浮空符文<</if>><<if $tower.meal>>、送餐盘<</if>><<if $tower.shield>>、防火盾<</if>><<if $tower.scroll>>、防火卷轴<</if>><<if $tower.loot>>、巨剑、逆重力护符（剩 <<print $tower.charges>> 次）<</if>>。</p>
</details>
<details class="tower-panel"><summary>探索地图 · <<print $tower.visited.length>> / 22</summary>
<p>你只标出了亲自到过的地方。上下楼不会改变时代；转动杖头，则留在同一层。</p>
<ol class="tower-map"><<for _i to 0; _i lt setup.towerRooms.length; _i++>>
<li><<if $tower.visited.includes(_i + ':past') or $tower.visited.includes(_i + ':present')>><<print setup.towerRooms[_i].name>><<else>>尚未探索<</if>> · 过去 <<print $tower.visited.includes(_i + ':past') ? '●' : '○'>> / 现在 <<print $tower.visited.includes(_i + ':present') ? '●' : '○'>></li>
<</for>></ol>
</details>
<details class="tower-panel"><summary>玩法与改编来源</summary><p>留意同一间屋子在过去与现在的不同，就能找到登塔的办法。任何角色都能走完本篇，关键线索无需掷骰；切换时代、查看手记都不扣生命或金币。物品和手记随你往返，不必重新收集。侧栏可以存档、读档或回退，抵达结局后也能回退尝试其他选择。</p><p>改编自 Jaclyn Lewis 的 <a href="https://jaclynlewis.itch.io/ascend-noustas-tower" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ascend Nousta’s Tower</a>（2023）。中文叙事、路线与结局有改写；本篇改编内容采用 <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CC BY-SA 4.0</a>。</p></details>
<<if $tower.ending>><<link "重新开始">><<run Engine.restart()>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
<</nobr>>
